<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks drop to 94,157.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks drop to 94,157.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Jan 17 totaled 94,157 bales, down from 94,249 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 418 bales issued, 1,530 decertification orders, 510 cancellations, and 1,711 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
